{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22030","headline":"有木诗八首 一 · 白居易","name":"有木诗八首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有木名弱柳，结根近清池。\n风烟借颜色，雨露助华滋。\n峨峨白雪花，嫋嫋青丝枝。\n渐密阴自庇，转高梢四垂。\n截枝扶爲杖，輭弱不自持。\n折条用樊圃，柔脆非其宜。\n爲树信可玩，论材何所施。\n可惜金堤地，栽之徒尔爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22030.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22030","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}